  "variation": {
    "seeded": true,
    "notes": "The notes' paths and sizes and the circle's angle change per cast; the beat (750 ms, four per loop) never does."
  },
  "director_notes": "Lisa asked for bard music auras. The new sparks look `note` draws music notes and `orbit_hz` circles them round the bard. Everything is locked to an 80 bpm beat: rings every 750 ms, glows pulsing at 1.33 Hz, four beats per 3 s loop, so the loop lands on a downbeat. Pairs with Rallying Anthem (the one-shot version). Loop 1200-4200 ms."
}
